*.log
.DS_Store
# No .env exists anywhere — not committed, not in the image, not required at
# build time. All runtime config comes from the Dokploy panel (see
# DEPLOY.md). This wildcard (with the negation below) is broader than the
# three variants it replaced, which would have let a stray .env.local or
# .env.testing slip through.
.env*
!.env.example
.phpactor.json
.phpunit.result.cache
